**The change** ([atwood-machine/index.html](atwood-machine/index.html))

- **`max-width: 1040px` on `main` is gone**, so the page uses the full window at every size.
- A new `@media (min-width: 900px)` block turns `main` into a grid, placing the existing sections by area — no script touched, so the reading order on phones is unchanged:
