- The apparatus switches from `position: sticky` to `static` on desktop (a sticky box inside a grid area can't scroll anyway), and the board is sized as `min(100%, (100dvh − 250px) × 1.25)` — the viewBox is 1000 × 800 — so the apparatus *and* its Release/Record/model bar fit one screen height instead of pushing the run bar off the bottom of a laptop screen.

