- `finishRun()` records the descent the run finished at (`xCm`, taken from the live `run.x`) alongside the fit and the direction.
- The board reads the descent from `run.x` while running, and from `state.last.xCm` afterwards. Both masses, the strings, the pulley rotation and the descent readout are all driven by that one value, so they hold the caught pose together. `run` was already the only thing that reset the board, and nothing else needed touching.
