| 900 × 800 (breakpoint) | 460 wide | 356 wide | stacked, no overflow in the Controls card |
| 800 | single column, board 752 wide, Controls/Hangers two-up | | tablet layout unchanged |
| 390 | single column, board 328 × 164, sticky, compact labels | | phone layout unchanged |

