**Working, not just laid out:** selecting a hanger shows the fine-move bar, dragging m1 moved it 15.0 → 10.2 cm with the bar following, and no console errors at any width. I cleared the saved state afterwards, so the page opens in Case 1 with a fresh random stick mass (90.2 g this run), and [README.md](torque-balance/README.md) gained a **Layout** section describing the breakpoints. Nothing is committed.
